From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:07:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 126/144] GreatDANE: source-level checks for leftover Firefox
 uses, l10n pins, CRLF, and SKIP (round 4f)

greatdane/tests/trademark_userfacing_check.py (no build, no signing, no network)
covers Frank's 11 leftover items and NGD 4d M1 / L1: unofficial About Terms /
Privacy / get-involved URLs, donate dropped only when unofficial, community
UTMs stripped only when unofficial, official branches unchanged, approved
dane-community-* wording intact, stock community-2 / community-exp restored,
module.ver / manifests / branding.nsi, Sync promo wording and hrefs with Sync
itself left enabled, default bookmarks, the documented firefox-wordmark.svg
chrome URL, and the greatdane-only VisualElements rename.

NGD L3: updater.ini fixtures are pinned to the ESR153 l10n-changesets
revision 3ae91662ee285b44f21ef31b9cae722d132e28ea. The six locale files are
byte-identical to that pin. locale_branding_check.py records the revision,
and if GREATDANE_L10N_CHECKOUT is set it iterates a real checkout.

NGD L4: generate_ini.py's maintenance-line regex no longer consumes \\r, so
CRLF input keeps CR. xx-CRLF.ini is a synthetic fixture for that case.

NGD L5: wordmark_branding_check.py reports SKIP, not PASS, when official
wordmark SVG, stock new-tab / private-browsing CSS, or aboutDialog.css are
absent from the snapshot.

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
